- AMD Ryzen AI Max: amd.com (Strix Halo, 128 ГБ LPDDR5X-8000, 256-бит)
- Apple M-серия: apple.com (архитектура unified memory)
- KTransformers: github.com/kvcache-ai/ktransformers (CPU-GPU heterogeneous, MoE offload, KT-FT preprint)
